[{"client_msg_id":"e6d17e14-0273-4992-9c17-2e151565e304","type":"message","user":"U0230SSJ32B","text":"例えば、popup_createの第2引数でポップアップが閉じたときに呼び出されるcallbackが指定できるので、そのcallbackが呼び出されたら `\u0026lt;C-c\u0026gt;` が入力されたとみなす+ポップアップを開き直す、みたいなイメージでいけるとおもいます。","ts":"1637427137.109100","thread_ts":"1637427137.109100","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UL5G6QL5U"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ua+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5481770a-d6fa-4b15-b8fe-fe61cb15da0a","type":"message","user":"U0230SSJ32B","text":"これだと `\u0026lt;C-c\u0026gt;` が押されたときにポップアップが閉じて、それ以降キーが取れなくなるので、 `\u0026lt;C-c\u0026gt;` （とそれ以降のキー入力）も扱えるようにしたいなら少し細工が必要ですね。","ts":"1637426732.105400","edited":{"user":"U0230SSJ32B","ts":"1637427009.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lxa7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8345ffe4-c307-4976-8e38-21527c6ed1c8","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"nvimだと、popup_createに相当するのが nvim_win_openのようなのですが、filterがないので無理かもしれないです。。\n\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/7942fb7074042694f63a983528adeefb61094627/runtime/doc/api.txt#L2712\u003e","ts":"1637425672.103800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/7942fb7074042694f63a983528adeefb61094627/runtime/doc/api.txt | api.txt\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/7942fb7074042694f63a983528adeefb61094627/runtime/doc/api.txt | api.txt\u003e","text":"```\nnvim_open_win({buffer}, {enter}, {*config})                  *nvim_open_win()*\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/neovim/neovim|neovim/neovim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PFre"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90a08d78-d463-4311-8697-0174d2025e4d","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`s:nop()` はなくてもよさそうです。`autocmd User KeyPress :` とかしておくと何もしないコマンドが登録されます","ts":"1637424434.102900","thread_ts":"1637424434.102900","last_read":"1637483568.109300","subscribed":true,"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UL5G6QL5U"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"38s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9373d08f-2d35-4297-9b58-31a32e986512","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"autocmdのKeyPressで発火してキーヒストリーを見れるようにしてみました！\n\u003chttps://github.com/ryicoh/keypress.vim\u003e\n```autocmd User KeyPress echo g:keypress#history[-1]```","ts":"1637424210.102200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"ryicoh/keypress.vim","id":1,"title":"ryicoh/keypress.vim","fields":[{"title":"Language","value":"Vim script","short":true},{"title":"Last updated","value":"2 minutes ago","short":true}],"blocks":null}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GRYQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"795d8ca9-7d8d-4b7b-b7ee-ce83268387ca","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/ryicoh/keypress.vim/commit/725693ab901838b924a65cada57c055dfad218e8\u003e\nありがとうございます、対応しました！\ncallbackでポップアップを一旦クローズしてもう一回作ろうとすると、そのクローズでまたcallbackが走っちゃうっていうので若干詰まってしまいましたが:sweat_smile:","ts":"1637483642.109500","thread_ts":"1637427137.109100","parent_user_id":"U0230SSJ32B","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AmzSI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1275080e-6be9-495b-9d60-6798fc56ce44","type":"message","user":"UL5G6QL5U","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/ryicoh/keypress.vim/commit/5131cd0236e06b82dd3d2cb5f3ed0019aa991065\u003e\nありがとうございます！","ts":"1637483568.109300","thread_ts":"1637424434.102900","parent_user_id":"U03C71D7H","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Yhw"}